{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/c1lpnt9htx3hkt74y7gn9ywxqlph2br.mp3","text":"护卫的职责可不是傻站着发呆，让在下陪您聊一会儿如何。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/371dw2uj54i85ovh3uyiwcmfvfjkh22.mp3","text":"定位准确，环境适当，在下手中的信件就一定会准时送达。毕竟这可是在下赖以生存的活计啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/lkvo17bfq23j9zunzutlvpk8u5u3kc7.mp3","text":"肚子饿了？想吃点什么尽管说，虽然比不上角峰大哥，在下对自己的手艺还是有点信心的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/6zx8m3mkmbxelsfsc68u48x1y72nixa.mp3","text":"罗德岛的通讯设备太发达了吧？这样下去......在下是要失业了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/dk4na0gxzhxajbxehi0uwir3239d4ld.mp3","text":"还有什么吩咐吗？可不要让在下等太久喔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/btn3frlxlneabbyfpjcmnjte1evz5ke.mp3","text":"唔？信件上会留下淡淡的味道？是错觉吧，错觉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/enhyxjcu7qarksfk35lx5a2cthadp9p.mp3","text":"银灰老板他对在下有救命之恩。如果是必要的事情，无论是什么，在下都会替他去做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/06/h97vyd6b4ue6yb1sxjzst2fq1686bul.mp3","text":"这些货物都要在下送吗？数量太多了吧，博士，别为难在下呀~","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/58p9rramg1nx892xcsq61265rnd5tiu.mp3","text":"真是败给你了......那我就暂且收起这营业性笑容好了。希望从今往后，我都能以真正的表情面对你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/bazd1qtt9w5fcpg5y49snhg7li5fzwo.mp3","text":"博士，有新的讯息......嘛，算了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ocvecys8qdgzc1ezwhdszssggnhvioj.mp3","text":"尊敬的罗德岛领袖，您的盟友，雪境的讯使在此。您与银灰老板的契约期内，碰上困难，就试着打个响指呼唤在下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/m68777s9c71ff4viejanbwe9y2v7fzd.mp3","text":"哇，完成了不得了的任务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/nzwi11n5uiwk1r4zdrz3qwjy6vnkz80.mp3","text":"让在下上场的话，您的工作一定会更加轻松的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/7uykpw5lruk5atfnurygjdkr5ytl6s7.mp3","text":"作为雪境的讯使，危急关头，在下定会立刻出现在您身边。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/odjuf4ga8d4z7rgaz78bfxkqflv79az.mp3","text":"那么，战场侦查就交给在下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/4vbeeu5fm9jtj2veg6qtt9nl0496jj0.mp3","text":"绝不辱没雪境之名。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/6okuucqfccnwdeqel160p6u5pvk5xjo.mp3","text":"总有人破坏这份难得的和谐，真可惜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/msbvcm43z9hwhg4q2wq1rhzhynzug9c.mp3","text":"他们会为此付出代价的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/rp9iy39g25td3olm4nrh1sc6bwgtdkf.mp3","text":"听从差遣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/qtjt35id7ckyuv1fk6elqxxgjken84y.mp3","text":"待命中。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/kfirjoi38gc5p3s2eherqmzomtq5gw0.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/45psedj8bfg4hm31pf223ll53xxxm5d.mp3","text":"进攻。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/qa8i6t4r5im0vyhw8k979bgim22u4io.mp3","text":"突击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/086m7ntk7mudvs7d0pfnks21568g6ip.mp3","text":"怎样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/dgu7jwde538t939gg99z2as47xmry5t.mp3","text":"哈——","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/7tu6e7oo7ge0ocrnqqkw86klf6enh7u.mp3","text":"加速！","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/enkm7zfhqcwm6cuwdtmss3qikx0e6nh.mp3","text":"让在下用最快的速度，将胜利的讯息送回罗德岛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/3jook5sg6u85c6f3tztrtzmurlldz1a.mp3","text":"清理完战场以后一起去吃顿好的如何，我请客。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/ll9xwtt4ahegvwnh41jiv6tcqrq371j.mp3","text":"有人受伤了吗，在下这里有药水和绷带。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/7evtfh73pyrx50ejus4fvksxgccq1y5.mp3","text":"先离开这儿——走这条路，快！","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/8srqw8igcd7e72v5b4s32fu8h2q8dww.mp3","text":"先和室友邻居们打个招呼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/t81kp871wv7nqoagbfexdtx546ahku6.mp3","text":"有事吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/g4bdx41r35ns69fbazb3mnf8zmbme8u.mp3","text":"好啦好啦，一会给你做点吃的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/bewnq5pda6a5qhnob2gl7vyur8c9r1e.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/ictvy5p0l6d5cfgtoorlus0xv28uuom.mp3","text":"博士，在下为您带来了谢拉格庆祝新年时会吃的食物。现在还热乎着，您尝一尝？......这么合您胃口吗？别、别吃这么多啊！兽肉没那么好消化的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/0xmm8cdg9tdv5xumtr2irfdf07a6l9r.mp3","text":"随时为您效劳。","alt":"voice_cn/char_198_blackd/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/djfnqq1s43v1scuqub48atvdgaklfwe.mp3","text":"护卫的职责可不是傻站着发呆，让在下陪您聊一会儿如何。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/eqsclxqc0ow497mvpi85tlgdw0wj9mm.mp3","text":"定位准确，环境适当，在下手中的信件就一定会准时送达。毕竟这可是在下赖以生存的活计啊。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/67hyy4vvd9094jwjexsbkyy7svhmcrc.mp3","text":"肚子饿了？想吃点什么尽管说，虽然比不上角峰大哥，在下对自己的手艺还是有点信心的。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/796dcmqttdfh88kqz8dn8gwuutwallp.mp3","text":"罗德岛的通讯设备太发达了吧？这样下去......在下是要失业了！","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/4y32bxpn4apk99dbpg5vy98ecuq9zdd.mp3","text":"还有什么吩咐吗？可不要让在下等太久喔。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/p149cot0rmwhjmrxvx7pqn26ybsjbzb.mp3","text":"唔？信件上会留下淡淡的味道？是错觉吧，错觉。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/8heysfnsw2vuc9jfis2orniup477to2.mp3","text":"银灰老板他对在下有救命之恩。如果是必要的事情，无论是什么，在下都会替他去做。","alt":"voice/char_198_blackd/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/jzohpcjy4y2b9jvvg0oqgco7t4bhb0v.mp3","text":"这些货物都要在下送吗？数量太多了吧，博士，别为难在下呀~